#: ../userguides/roads_model.rst:14 33f015cd5e8b45f180b1297a05fb4c5e
msgid ""
"The model is trained mostly on rural and suburban areas. Multi-task "
"learning keeps the road mask connected where trees or buildings hide the "
"road. It can fail in cities with wide roads, sidewalks and complex "
"crossings."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/roads_model.rst:18 f2d85ef8cb91468e8380f98b278bfd78
