#: ../userguides/roads_model.rst:47 eb30123168f3476186054dee97a1f325
msgid ""
"By default, 🚗 **Roads** is delivered **post-processed**: the road mask is"
" reduced to centrelines, cleaned (simplification, merging of gaps, "
"removal of double, short and detached edges) and inflated back into tidy "
"polygons — a connected, map-ready network for mapping and routing."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/roads_model.rst:51 300818e7013440c5b7099dab0946a436
msgid ""
"A **no post-processing** variant keeps the raw segmentation mask, which "
"covers the full **road surface area** — wide roads, junctions and paved "
"surfaces included. Because it captures total road coverage rather than a "
"thin connected graph, it is intended for **land-use / land-cover "
"classification**, where the share of surface occupied by roads matters "
"more than network topology."
msgstr ""

