#: ../userguides/roads_model.rst:132 23557b2ddda84f86bf8048dd2b01fa99
msgid ""
"We evaluated the update using open benchmark datasets, including "
"`SpaceNet 3 Roads <https://spacenet.ai/spacenet-roads-dataset/>`_, "
"supplemented with our own validation data across different urban "
"environments."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/roads_model.rst:136 123a586d51a24a68a4ee74cfc5b931a8
msgid "We focused on two complementary metrics:"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/roads_model.rst:138 135aaa5b55fa438d8dd46b006b312965
msgid ""
"**IoU (Intersection over Union)** measures how accurately the predicted "
"road mask matches the actual road coverage. It tells us how well the "
"model identifies roads and captures their spatial extent."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/roads_model.rst:141 8ad7e2d8c9154ce3a4dadb6c2b9783f0
msgid ""
"**Topology F1 (Topo-F1)** evaluates the connectivity of the extracted "
"road network. This is particularly important for mapping and routing, "
"where roads need to remain connected even when partially obscured by "
"vegetation, buildings or shadows."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/roads_model.rst:145 36589015860645a5a8947f70ef36fde6
msgid ""
